{"articleNo":"808","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=808&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▣ 2009 안동대학교 여름계절수업 수학 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.05.13","hit":"19392","attachments":[{"name":"타대학수학신청원(2009).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=808&attachNo=69684"},{"name":"2009 안동대 여름계절수업 수업시간표.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=808&attachNo=70934"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2009학년도 안동대학교 여름계절수업 수학 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 수업기간 : 2009. 6.&nbsp; 22(월) - 7. 10(금) [3주간]</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 수업시간표 : 붙임 참조</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 수강학점 : 6학점 이내</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 수강료 : 학점당 35,000원.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 단, 영어, 컴퓨터, 예능계 교과목은 시간당 35,000원</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">【 시간당 강좌 : 초급영어회화Ⅰ,초급영어회화</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">,컴퓨터기초 】</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 지원자격 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 재학생으로서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2개학기 이상을 이수한 자.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균이</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 3.0 이상인 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6. 수강신청안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수학신청기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; COLOR: #0033ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009. 5. 20(수)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">타대학 수학신청서 1부.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 신청서제출 및 수강료 납부장소 : 각 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 수강신청 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">추천서류에 의거 안동대학교 학사관; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"&gt;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">7. 교과목 폐강</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 수강인원이 10명 미만일 경우 폐강함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 폐강된 경우 수강료를 반환함 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(폐강된 경우 외에는 수강료를 반환하지 않음)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">8. 성적통보일 : 2009. 7. 22(수) </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">9. 수강신청시 유의사항</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 성적인정 교과목을 각 학부 사무실 및 교양교직원에&nbsp; 확인 후 작성</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 선수과목이 필요한 과목을 신청할 경우 이수여부를 확인한 후 신청</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; COLOR: #0066ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; COLOR: #0066ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">8학기차졸업예정자 및 2009-2학기 타대학 편입학 예정자들은 수학신청 불가</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(재수강 불가) </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">교 무 연 구 과 장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
